T* (  This instrument measures the chemical and isotopic composition of individual dust                                               ) Tj
T* (particles \(Fig. 5\). When a dust particle impacts on the instrument's target, a plasma                                             ) Tj
T* (is generated, from which ions are extracted and accelerated via a 1.5 kV acceleration                                             ) Tj
