T* (where they are separated in time according to their mass. The spectrum of elements                                                ) Tj
T* (of which the dust particle is composed is recorded by an electron multiplier at the end                                           ) Tj
T* (of the drift path. Since the elemental abundances of typical minerals found in                                                    ) Tj
T* (meteorites vary significantly, it is possible to identify the predominant mineral in the                                          ) Tj
T* (impacting dust grain from the quantitative abundance in the spectrum.                                                             ) Tj
